Usage: cp [-hrf] [--json] SOURCE DEST

  -h, --help           Show help and exit.
  -r, --recursive      Copy directories recursively.
  -f, --force          Retry failed destination opens.
  --json               Emit UTF-8 operation summary.
  SOURCE               One source path.
  DEST                 One destination path.

Copy files; existing destinations are resized and overwritten.
Directory DEST receives SOURCE basename. -r copies links as links.
Failures can leave partial results; concurrent changes unsupported.
Exit status: 0 success, 1 operational failure, 2 argument error.
